12
00:56:12,631 --> 00:56:18,631
Starring Callan McAuliffe, Madeline Carroll, Rebecca De Mornay, Anthony Edwards,
John Mahoney, Penelope Ann Miller, Aidan Quinn, and Kevin Weisman.

13
01:00:53,684 --> 01:00:59,684
The film tells the story of Juli and Bryce, neighbors since the second grade who are never on the same page with their feelings until six
years later (just when she is about to give up) they both start to have feelings for each other, despite being total opposites.

14
01:05:34,736 --> 01:05:40,736
Flipped was released in theaters in the United States
on August 6, 2010, by Warner Bros.

15
